    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alice in the Manor</strong> is a point-and-click escape adventure game. <br>You must explore every corner of a large manor filled with various puzzles and gimmicks and escape safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a mysterious letter arrives for Alice. <br>It was none other than an admission letter from a magic school. <br>However, to be admitted, she must pass a special test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The test takes place in an old manor. <br>Inside, suspicious rooms and secret puzzles await Alice. <br>Will Alice be able to complete this mysterious test and enter the magic school? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A variety of creative puzzles and gimmicks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fun of searching for and collecting clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous rooms with different themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intuitive hint system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm and charming graphics</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alice in the Manor</strong> is a point-and-click escape adventure game. <br>You must explore every corner of a large manor filled with various puzzles and gimmicks and escape safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a mysterious letter arrives for Alice. <br>It was none other than an admission letter from a magic school. <br>However, to be admitted, she must pass a special test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The test takes place in an old manor. <br>Inside, suspicious rooms and secret puzzles await Alice. <br>Will Alice be able to complete this mysterious test and enter the magic school? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A variety of creative puzzles and gimmicks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fun of searching for and collecting clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous rooms with different themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intuitive hint system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm and charming graphics</p></li></ul>",
